# The repo is authored with LF. Without this, a Windows checkout converts to CRLF
# and every file fails `npm run lint` (prettier/prettier "Delete ␍"), while the
# Linux build on Vercel sees LF — an inconsistency that shows up as phantom diffs.
#
# This only governs NEW checkouts and newly-touched files. To normalise the
# existing tree in one commit:
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "Normalise line endings to LF"
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.webp binary
